{"id": "De6CLqByLwF", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Papa ne apni poori zindagi ek blackboard pe likhi… aur uska sabse sundar shabd main tha 🤍\n\nEk chalk, ek blackboard, ek baap ki poori kahani: baarish mein ek chhatri, khoye hue maa-baap, aur Bilari ka woh school jo unke papa ka sapna tha.\nHar yaad ke baad duster chalta hai… par blackboard kabhi poora bhoolta nahi.\nPhir ek din “garv” mitaakar “Parv” likha gaya.\nChalk ghiste ghiste ek chhota sa tukda reh gaya… aur aakhri lakeer bete ki siyaahi ne poori ki.\n\nAur front row mein, chalk se bane papa, sabse zor se taali bajaate hue.\n\n🎵 Chhota Ladka · Parv · music Aditya Pushkarna · Hustle 5 (Apna Homeground)\n@itsparvman @mtvhustle \n\nYe reel apne papa ko bhejo… ya us dost ko jo apne papa ka garv hai 🤍\n\nChhota Ladka Parv | Parv Hustle 5 | Hustle 5 Apna Homeground | Chhota Ladka song | father son rap | papa song Hindi rap | emotional Hindi rap | blackboard chalk art | chalk animation | Bilari Moradabad\n\n#ChhotaLadka #Parv #Hustle5 #ApnaHomeground #ChalkArt", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792908759, "like_count": 7544, "comment_count": 47, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2528147077694543a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.124, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOGJTk-feDBLTfZ8J6ZhZ_A0gU9ki6_hER0Vkc98O6iGCpTHLuOYPL38UQy9I1JZB-SLnDPqKoOByftQfairMfKpPfs8vtemN3a4jE.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoNgbzErwMKU8bMigVumaabrbKiaeP9o1N84O5DBmmHUHpk9SD4aeTcNedV3eQOSJJeetYQp